{"id":"steam-1113840","steam":1113840,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Tinselfly","summary":"Immerse yourself in the story and worlds of Tinselfly, a surreal and introspective adventure about dreams, nostalgia, and pretty spaceships. Tinselfly features character-driven puzzles and a visual, intuitive sword fighting system.","about":"Tinselfly is an adventure game set in a whimsical science fantasy universe. Play as Robin Aetherspring, a listless starship engineer who once had dreams of bounding through the cosmos. When Robin's ship becomes trapped in a bizarre starship graveyard, she must investigate its origins, free her crew, and rediscover her love of exploration.\r\n\r\nTinselfly features a visual, intuitive sword fighting system and character-driven puzzles.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113840/library_600x900.jpg?t=1702411791","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113840/header.jpg?t=1702411791","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113840/library_hero.jpg?t=1702411791","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113840/header.jpg?t=1702411791","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113840/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1702411791","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113840/ss_72d85df6fc88d05b361cdee99669a56a3412f59d.600x338.jpg?t=1702411791","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113840/ss_72d85df6fc88d05b361cdee99669a56a3412f59d.jpg?t=1702411791"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113840/ss_f6d77447eeb3e570ac9c8f37895c15c37128e014.600x338.jpg?t=1702411791","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113840/ss_f6d77447eeb3e570ac9c8f37895c15c37128e014.jpg?t=1702411791"},{"thumb":"https: